# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored — never commit the real token.
#
# Notion internal integration token ("Portfolio Site Sync"), starts with ntn_.
# Read-only is sufficient. The parent page must be shared with the integration
# or the API returns 404 on pages that load fine in a browser.
#
# In CI this comes from the GitHub Actions secret of the same name.
NOTION_TOKEN=

# The like counter's endpoint — the Worker in workers/likes/, which is the only
# thing that holds a write token and the only thing that talks to Notion at
# runtime. PUBLIC_ because Astro exposes it to the browser, which is the whole
# point: it is a URL, not a credential.
#
# LEAVE IT EMPTY and the count lives in each visitor's own browser and the
# plant still grows for them. Set it and the count becomes everybody's. It is
# read at BUILD time, so setting it afterwards changes nothing until the next
# build. workers/likes/README.md has the deploy steps.
PUBLIC_LIKES_ENDPOINT=
